Omecore2.1 user guide!

The omecore2.1 is a 4-bit hexadecimal computer that me and pavlepuchika developed. 

Specs:
8 words of ram, whitch 3 are memory mapped (mm in book)
15 addresses "Bytes" of rom
a 7s clock (will be changed in future updates
2 registers for the ocore2.2 alu and 1 for holding the bus value.
some additional instructions to the ocore2.2

The ISA and the memory mappings can be found in the book *next to the omecore controls*
i will keep a changelog of future updates.

in the github repo there is also programs for the omecore2.1 as well as the .schems for the ocore2.2
